  {"note": "The S-parameters page: two solves kept and listed, the phase shown, a band picked and refined with 21 points (7 to 8 GHz in steps of 0.05, merged into the sweep), the table unfolded, a click at 7.32 GHz opening the field at the nearest solved 7.3 GHz"},
